== Icelandic ==
===Etymology===
From ''[[þrjátíu]]'' meaning "[[thirty]]" + ''[[og]]'' "[[and]]" + ''[[sex]]'' "[[six]]". Meaning '''thirty and six'''.
=== Cardinal number ===

'''þrjátíu og sex''' {{indecl}}

# [[thirty-six]], cardinal number after [[þrjátíu og fimm]] and before [[þrjátíu og sjö]]

